  "$comment": "Golden vectors for coordinator.v1 SyncEvent.version. Every implementation (the TS helpers in this package, fc-coordinator's handler and SQL paths, fc-mobile) must agree with every case. Grammar: <instant>[#<counter>#<device>], instant = YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.ffffffZ (UTC, exactly six fractional digits), counter = 10 decimal digits, device = 32 lowercase hex (a dashless uuid). Order is bytewise over the ASCII text. Tokens in the grammar order the same under C, glibc and ICU collations; collationTraps are out-of-grammar pairs that do not, which is why a server rejects an out-of-grammar token before storing it.",
